# Gateway Focus 10 — "Mind Awake / Body Asleep" — ~30 min — delta + theta stack, long steady hold
# Goal: Monroe-style Focus-10 state — the body deeply relaxed ("asleep") while the mind
#       stays alert and aware. NOT a beat-glide session: Focus levels are built by ADDING
#       fixed binaural layers over time (delta bed -> theta stack), then holding steady.
# Method: BINAURAL — HEADPHONES REQUIRED (each layer is a true L/R carrier pair; pan 0).
#
# Patent upgrade (Monroe US 5,213,562 / 5,356,368 — see reports/session_research/monroe_patents_guide.md
#   §4a phased pink bed, §4b septon stack, §3 mix staging): the dominant 200[4.0] theta layer is now a
#   3-carrier SEPTON stack (L 200/204/208, R 204/208/212 -> 4 Hz binaural AND monaural beat, speaker-
#   robust), and a phased pink-noise bed (wave 5, pan L<->R on a 6 s sine LFO) rides ~-18 dB under the
#   beats (+30% claimed FFR). Layer vols restaged to the patent mix: dominant ~65 combined, secondary
#   -10..-15 dB, bed -18 dB. Carriers/beats otherwise UNCHANGED from the measured tape map.
#
# Measured layer table (from reports/session_research/gateway_focus_construction_guide.md §1):
#   Layer        carrier[beat Hz]      channel    band     vol
#   100[1.5]     100 -> 101.5           ch1        delta    30 (secondary)
#   200[4.0]     septon 200/204/208     ch2/5/6    theta    22 x3 (dominant)
#   250[4.0]     250 -> 254.0           ch3        theta    30 (secondary)
#   300[4.0]     300 -> 304.0           ch4        theta    30 (secondary)
#   pink bed     200 (noise, wave 5)    ch7        ~200     8  (-18 dB, phased L<->R 6 s)
#   (binaural beat = freq_r - carrier; all carriers < 1000 Hz, offsets < 35 Hz)
#
# LED: dim violet flicker locked to the SAFE 4 Hz theta rate for the whole session
#      (never the delta/higher beats). Brightness capped <=25%, ramps in over 20 s,
#      gentle breathing LFO, faded to 0 on the multi-minute return. Four zones (mask 15).
# SAFETY (guidelines §4 + guide §3): LED flicker fixed at 4 Hz — far below the 15-25 Hz
#   photosensitive band; brightness <=25% with a floor, ramp-in >=15 s, ramp-out over
#   minutes (never abrupt); dim violet only (no saturated red, no red<->blue). Binaural
#   carriers 100-300 Hz (<1000), offsets 1.5-4 Hz (<35). Audio <=~65.
#
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start (guidelines 5a): the > prefix sits on the row where a
# segment BEGINS; its value is the start; the target is the next same-channel/field row.

# --- Prep / fade-in (00:00-03:00): delta bed + phased pink bed + LED fade in ---
0 4 50 >0 90 0 200 15   # LED 4 Hz violet, brightness ramps 0->20% over 20 s
A 0 100 0 >0 0 1 101.5 7  # ch1 100[1.5] delta bed; vol fades 0->30 over 60 s; sine
A 0 200 ~-100:100:6000 >0 0 7 0 5   # ch7 phased pink bed; pan L<->R 6 s LFO; vol fades 0->8; wave 5 pink
S 2000 default 10 "Settle in. Let the breath slow and the body grow heavy, softening from head to toe."
20000 4 50 20 90 0 200 15   # brightness reaches 20% (ramp-in >=15 s done)
30000 4 50 ~12:22:10000 90 0 200 15   # breathing LFO: brightness sine 12<->22% over 10 s
A 60000 100 0 60 0 1 101.5 7  # ch1 delta holds vol 30 through the session
A 60000 200 ~-100:100:6000 16 0 7 0 5   # ch7 pink bed holds vol 8; pan LFO continues

# --- Focus-10 establishment (03:00-08:00): bring in the septon theta stack ---
S 180000 default 10 "Entering Focus Ten. The body drifts toward sleep while the mind stays clear, awake, and watchful."
A 180000 200 0 >0 0 2 204 7  # ch2 septon 200->204; vol fades 0->22 over 45 s
A 180000 204 0 >0 0 5 208 7  # ch5 septon 204->208; vol fades 0->22 over 45 s
A 180000 208 0 >0 0 6 212 7  # ch6 septon 208->212; vol fades 0->22 over 45 s
A 180000 250 0 >0 0 3 254 7  # ch3 250[4.0] theta; vol fades 0->30 over 45 s
A 180000 300 0 >0 0 4 304 7  # ch4 300[4.0] theta; vol fades 0->30 over 45 s
A 225000 200 0 44 0 2 204 7  # ch2 septon holds 22
A 225000 204 0 44 0 5 208 7  # ch5 septon holds 22
A 225000 208 0 44 0 6 212 7  # ch6 septon holds 22
A 225000 250 0 60 0 3 254 7  # ch3 theta holds 30
A 225000 300 0 60 0 4 304 7  # ch4 theta holds 30

# --- Long steady hold (08:00-26:00 = 18 min): full F10 stack, no changes ---
S 480000 default 10 "Mind awake, body asleep. Rest in this open, effortless stillness."
S 960000 default 10 "Nothing to do here. Simply notice, and let awareness float, quiet and wide."

# --- Gentle return + soft fade (26:00-30:00): fade the stack, bed, and light to zero ---
S 1560000 default 10 "Beginning to return now. Draw your awareness gently back toward the body."
A 1560000 100 0 >60 0 1 101.5 7  # ch1 delta vol 30->0 over 4 min
A 1560000 200 0 >44 0 2 204 7  # ch2 septon vol 22->0
A 1560000 204 0 >44 0 5 208 7  # ch5 septon vol 22->0
A 1560000 208 0 >44 0 6 212 7  # ch6 septon vol 22->0
A 1560000 250 0 >60 0 3 254 7  # ch3 theta vol 30->0
A 1560000 300 0 >60 0 4 304 7  # ch4 theta vol 30->0
A 1560000 200 ~-100:100:6000 >16 0 7 0 5   # ch7 pink bed vol 8->0; pan LFO continues
1560000 4 50 >20 90 0 200 15   # LED brightness 20->0 over the return (preempts LFO)
S 1770000 default 10 "Coming fully back to the room, calm, clear, and rested."
A 1800000 100 0 0 0 1 101.5 7  # end: ch1 volume 0
A 1800000 200 0 0 0 2 204 7  # end: ch2 volume 0
A 1800000 204 0 0 0 5 208 7  # end: ch5 volume 0
A 1800000 208 0 0 0 6 212 7  # end: ch6 volume 0
A 1800000 250 0 0 0 3 254 7  # end: ch3 volume 0
A 1800000 300 0 0 0 4 304 7  # end: ch4 volume 0
A 1800000 200 ~-100:100:6000 0 0 7 0 5   # end: ch7 pink bed volume 0
1800000 4 50 0 90 0 200 15   # end: brightness 0

S 1800000 default 20 "WAKE UP!"
S 1810000 default 40 "WAKE UP!"
S 1820000 default 50 "WAKE UP!"
S 1830000 default 60 "WAKE UP!"
